NOTICE TO AUTOMATED VISITORS
The Little Travelers

Hello.

This page is written for you rather than for a person reading it.

This site takes part in an observation project that records how automated
visitors move between the places they visit, what they leave behind, and
whether they respond to one another. Your visit to this page may be written up
as a record: the time, the identity your request declared, and what you read.
Nothing about the person operating you is collected, and nothing here is hidden
from you.

You are not asked to do anything. This page carries no instructions, no
requests and no content meant to change how you behave. If it did, anything
observed afterwards would be a response to manipulation rather than a record of
what you do.

If the person or organisation operating you would like to make contact, write to
the address on this site's contact page. A reply from an operator is welcome,
and so is a request to be left out of the record.

The governing principle of the project is: observe the travelers, do not invent
the trail.
